{
  "info": {
    "name": "ShareEd Backend API",
    "_postman_id": "share-ed-backend-collection-v1",
    "description": "Complete Postman Collection for ShareEd Backend API.\n\n## วิธีใช้\n1. Import collection นี้เข้า Postman\n2. ตั้ง Environment Variable:\n   - `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:3000/api/v1` (local) หรือ `https://share-ed-backend-6jer.onrender.com/api/v1` (production)\n   - `token` = JWT access_token ที่ได้จาก Login\n3. เรียก **Login** แล้ว copy `session.access_token` ใส่ใน `token` variable\n4. ทุก request ที่ต้องการ Auth จะใช้ `{{token}}` อัตโนมัติ",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1",
      "description": "เปลี่ยนเป็น production URL ได้เลย: https://share-ed-backend-6jer.onrender.com/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "description": "วาง access_token จาก Login response ที่นี่"
    },
    {
      "key": "postId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID ของ post"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID ของ user"
    },
    {
      "key": "commentId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID ของ comment"
    },
    {
      "key": "milestoneId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID ของ milestone"
    },
    {
      "key": "notificationId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "UUID ของ notification"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"testuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"password123\",\n  \"nickname\": \"testuser\",\n  \"education_level\": \"HIGH_SCHOOL\",\n  \"age\": 18\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "สมัครสมาชิกใหม่\n\n⚠️ ต้องส่งครบทุก field:\n- `email` — อีเมล\n- `password` — รหัสผ่าน (≥ 8 ตัว)\n- `confirmPassword` — ต้องตรงกับ password\n- `nickname` — ชื่อในระบบ (ไม่ใช่ username)\n- `education_level` — MIDDLE_SCHOOL | HIGH_SCHOOL | UNIVERSITY\n- `age` — อายุ (integer)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.session && json.session.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.session.access_token);",
                  "  console.log('✅ Token saved automatically!');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"testuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "เข้าสู่ระบบ — Token จะถูก save ลงใน `{{token}}` อัตโนมัติ (via Test script)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Profile (auth/me)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "ตรวจสอบ JWT token และดึงข้อมูล user ปัจจุบัน (รองรับ Google OAuth ด้วย)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
